      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "「ニグリア鉱山」で遊んでた時に\n出口でお気に入りの髪留めを落としちゃったの。\n山賊がうろつくようになって、捜しにいけなくて……\n誰か見つけてきてくれないかな……",
        "official_en": "I was playing in Niraga Mine, and accidentally lost\nmy favorite hair clip near the exit. Now there's\nthieves hanging around the mine, so I can't go find\nmy clip. I wish someone could help find it for me...",
        "real_en": "I was playing in Nigria Mine, and accidentally lost\nmy favorite hair clip near the exit. Now there's\nthieves hanging around the mine, so I can't go find\nmy clip. I wish someone could help find it for me..."
      },
      "review": {
